Thai Waters Rev F | rail_derated_slow
* 12 uF effective, ESR 0.080 ohm, 12 us latency, 8 us response.
* Model: Incremental charge-deficit bound prior to loop recovery around 3.30 V. Wi-Fi current step is assumed.
Vref v 0 3.3
Rslow v rail 200
Resr rail cap 0.08
Ceff cap 0 12u
Iload rail 0 PWL(0 0 50u 0 50.1u 0.35 250u 0.35)
Iloop 0 rail PWL(0 0 62u 0 70u 0.35 250u 0.35)
.TRAN .2u 200u 0 .2u
.PRINT TRAN V(rail)
.END
